@startuml
title RF7 — Preparar time (LED 3D, relatório do adversário) e jogar partida · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
control "ClubAnalyst" as ClubAnalyst
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
database "S3/MinIO" as S3
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
Manager -> Frontend: Preparar time
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/next-game/preparation
API -> UseCase: GetGamePreparationUseCase.execute(id, userId)
UseCase -> MySQL: save, fixture SCHEDULED, ativos, depth chart, game plan, estádio, clima
alt não é dono / desempregado / semana de folga
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(ACCESS_DENIED) se 403
  API --> Frontend: 403 | 200 byeWeek
else senão
  UseCase -> Redis: GET match:{fixtureId}:snapshot (retomar?)
  UseCase -> S3: publicUrl(models3d/…)
  API --> Frontend: 200 PreparationResult
end
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/next-game/opponent-report
API -> UseCase: GetOpponentReportUseCase.execute(id, userId)
UseCase -> ClubAnalyst: opponentReport(opponent, últimos jogos, depth charts)
ClubAnalyst --> UseCase: tendências por unidade + keyMatchups (WR×CB, OL×DL)
API --> Frontend: 200 OpponentReport
Frontend -> Manager: modal LED 3D com confrontos-chave
Manager -> Frontend: Jogar partida
Frontend -> API: POST /careers/{id}/weeks/current/play
API -> UseCase: PlayWeekUseCase.execute(id, userId) «@Transactional»
UseCase -> MySQL: fixtures da semana anterior FINISHED? depth chart validated?
alt semana anterior pendente ou depth chart inválido
  API --> Frontend: 409 WEEK_NOT_COMPLETED | 422 DEPTH_CHART_INVALID
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: estado completo (depth chart, plano, playbook, especiais, moral, estádio, clima, regras)
  UseCase -> UseCase: seed = SeedPolicy.derive(save.seed, season, week, fixtureId)
  UseCase -> MatchSimulator: start(MatchSetup)
  MatchSimulator --> UseCase: snapshot KICKOFF (quarto 1, 15:00, kickoff da 35)
  UseCase -> Redis: SET match:{fid}:snapshot (TTL 24 h)
  UseCase -> MySQL: INSERT match_session · fixture.status = LIVE
  UseCase -> AuditService: record(MATCH_STARTED, seed)
  UseCase -> Scheduler: WeekSimulationJob: jogos da IA
  Scheduler -> MatchSimulator: simula por descida até o fim, por fixture da IA
  Scheduler -> MySQL: fixtures da IA FINISHED + stats + standings
  Scheduler -> Cassandra: appendPlayEvents por fixture (play-by-play)
  API --> Frontend: 201 {matchId}
  Frontend -> Manager: partida ao vivo (RF27)
end
@enduml
